sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Gateway intended local user and safety workflows
    accDescr: Design from SUMMARY and interface contracts. Camera code on feat/server currently only prints a greeting.
    participant U as User and LCD
    participant C as C0 gateway design
    participant V as Local YOLO11n
    participant D as D0 closer design
    participant S as Implemented Worker API
    U->>C: O check-in or X check-out
    C->>V: Capture camera frame and detect grocery
    V-->>C: Crop if confidence at least 0.60, otherwise full frame
    C->>S: JPEG draft request with Bearer and stable operation ID
    S-->>C: Bilingual metadata or FEFO candidate list
    C-->>U: Review expiry or select matching item
    U->>C: Confirm selection or cancel
    C->>S: Commit confirmed operation
    S-->>C: Persisted outcome
    C-->>U: Show success or retryable error
    Note over C,D: Separate local safety path, no cloud dependency
    C->>V: Door ajar over 60 s, check for people
    V-->>C: No person detected
    C->>D: MQTT TLS CLOSE_DOOR with cmd_id
    D-->>C: Acknowledgement and status events
    alt Person approaches during motion
        V-->>C: Human detected
        C->>D: MQTT TLS ABORT
    else Hardware obstruction
        D->>D: INA219 cutoff and bounded safe retract
    end
    D-->>C: Final result
    C->>S: Report or store-and-forward door event
    Note over U,C: PIR wakes camera/display, inactivity sleep is a design requirement
